{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"setup","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Attributes"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"activityType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Attributes","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15PushwooshBridge16PWLiveActivitiesP0a4LiveD0E5setupyyqd__mAD0aE18ActivityAttributesRd__lFZ0H0L_qd__mfp"},{"text":".Type) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Attributes"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","preciseIdentifier":"s:23PushwooshLiveActivities0aB18ActivityAttributesP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"activityType","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your custom attributes type conforming to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method sets up automatic token registration and activity lifecycle management"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"for your custom "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":" type."}]},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this for ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"every","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" attributes type you use, at app launch — in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"text":" (or the ","type":"text"},{"code":"App.init","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for SwiftUI apps)."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is what re-attaches the SDK to activities that are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"already running"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" at launch and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-uploads their per-activity push token to the server, so remote updates keep working after","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a cold start — including an activity that started (or was scheduled to start) while the app was","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"terminated. This is a required, one-time-per-launch call, not tied to any screen: ActivityKit"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exposes running activities only through the concrete ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Activity<Attributes>"},{"text":" generic and does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not persist the set of types across launches, so the SDK cannot reconnect a type it hasn’t been","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"told about in the current session. Registering a type lazily (e.g. in a view’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAppear"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"means the server can’t update that activity until that screen is opened. The call is idempotent,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so registering at launch and again per-screen is safe."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Configures Live Activities with custom attributes.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge\/PWLiveActivities\/setup(_:)"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshLiveActivities","relatedModules":["PushwooshBridge"]}],"externalID":"s:15PushwooshBridge16PWLiveActivitiesP0a4LiveD0E5setupyyqd__mAD0aE18ActivityAttributesRd__lFZ","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.1"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"PushwooshBridge","title":"setup(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setup"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Attributes"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"text":"Attributes","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15PushwooshBridge16PWLiveActivitiesP0a4LiveD0E5setupyyqd__mAD0aE18ActivityAttributesRd__lFZ0H0L_qd__mfp"},{"text":".Type)","kind":"text"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshbridge\/pwliveactivities\/setup(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge\/PWLiveActivities"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivit